### uplus_probe
f.var            ok 1         ok 1         ok 1   B=1:A=+B / PRINT A   refs agree
           unary + on a VARIABLE
f.paren          ok 1         ok 1         ok 1   A=(+1) / PRINT A   refs agree
           inside parentheses
f.bin            ok 3         ok 3         ok 3   A=1++2 / PRINT A   refs agree
           binary + then unary +
x.dbl            ok 1         ok 1         ok 1   A=++1 / PRINT A   refs agree
           🔴 TWO unary pluses -- the identity arm re-enters ev_f
x.mixed         ok -1        ok -1        ok -1   A=+-1 / PRINT A   refs agree
           plus then minus
x.pow            ok 4         ok 4         ok 4   A=+2^2 / PRINT A   refs agree
           binding vs `^` (identity makes both readings 4)
x.str            ok X         ok X         ok X   A$="X":B$=+A$ / PRINT B$   refs agree
           🔴 unary + on a STRING -- unmeasured, and the fix reaches it
x.strlit         ok X         ok X         ok X   B$=+"X" / PRINT B$   refs agree
           ...on a string LITERAL
x.prstr          ok X         ok X         ok X   A$="X" / PRINT +A$   refs agree
           ...in the PRINT factor position

